                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#313131;" value="One pass through the Factory, as activity clusters. Foundation runs once per project; specification, implementation and reconciliation repeat per change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#305bab&quot;&gt;Blue&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a producing step. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9b4a08&quot;&gt;Orange&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a review of that step. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#af7e04&quot;&gt;Yellow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: deterministic gates. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#067429&quot;&gt;Green&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: the state a cluster leaves behind.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solid arrow&lt;/b&gt;: leads to. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6631d7&quot;&gt;Purple dashed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: feeds the next change, arrowhead at the target. Layout: draw.io elkLayered." vertex="1">
