                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Noto Sans;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#313131;" value="Planning and building in detail, from the agent definitions, the create-backlog sequence, and scripts/dispatch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#305bab&quot;&gt;Blue&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: an agent step. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9b4a08&quot;&gt;Orange&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a human step. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#af7e04&quot;&gt;Yellow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a gate or a decision. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#bd0a0a&quot;&gt;Red&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a failure path. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6631d7&quot;&gt;Lilac&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a step from the accepted core-artifact-ownership proposal, not yet built. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#bd0a0a&quot;&gt;White with a red border&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a gap in the Factory today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6631d7&quot;&gt;Purple dashed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a planned loop, such as a stakeholder pause or the next story. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#bd0a0a&quot;&gt;Red dashed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: a failure loop. Loop arrowheads point at the step that runs again. Layout: draw.io elkLayered." vertex="1">
